# Working scratch space for image experiments (derivatives are committed;
# anything in assets/scratch is throwaway).
assets/scratch/

# The owner's supplied files as originally dropped in. These are preserved in
# the repository at assets/originals/ instead, byte-for-byte identical and
# verified with cmp. Ignoring this directory avoids committing 22 MB twice.
# It is left on disk rather than deleted — remove it manually once you are
# satisfied assets/originals/ is the copy you want to keep.
/photos/

